## Follow-up fix after review

Review finding (minor, cosmetic): `.contract-blocks` stretched the two-column cards to equal row
height, so the operation-types card and the sync-message-types card carried blank bordered space
below their content. Fixed with `align-items: start` on `.contract-blocks` in `preview.css`; no other
layout value changed and the section h2 stays at `var(--text-22)` per the brief.

The preview was served again on the slot web port (`web=4100` from `.polier-slot`), the section was
re-measured with the same temporary same-origin probe (removed again before the commit) and the
section image was re-shot with the same commands and crop method as above:

```
desktop viewport=1440x900 scrollWidth=1425 clientWidth=1425 bodyScrollWidth=1425 pageHeight=6732 contractTop=953 contractBottom=2555 contractHeight=1603 contractWidth=1136 blockHeights=474,253,249,333,176 chips=31 errors=7 links=3 demoCardMoved=true demoStatus=Zoom 110 percent. zoomScale=1.10 masthead=Last change: P1-07 — Contract overview in the preview | 2026-10-25 13:57 (Europe/Zurich) firstFact=0.1.0
mobile viewport=390x844 scrollWidth=375 clientWidth=375 bodyScrollWidth=375 pageHeight=11634 contractTop=1195 contractBottom=4408 contractHeight=3213 contractWidth=343 blockHeights=528,359,326,369,303 chips=31 errors=7 links=3
tall viewport=1440x3400 scrollWidth=1425 clientWidth=1425 bodyScrollWidth=1425 pageHeight=6732 contractTop=953 contractBottom=2555 contractHeight=1603 contractWidth=1136 blockHeights=474,253,249,333,176 chips=31 errors=7 links=3
```

`blockHeights` lists the four block cards plus the full-width proof block in DOM order (schema
families, operation types, sync message types, error codes, fixture proof). The operation-types card
is now 253 px tall instead of stretching to the schema-families row height (474 px), and the
sync-message-types card is 249 px instead of stretching to the error-codes height (333 px). No blank
bordered space remains under either card's content. The section bounds are unchanged (top 953,
bottom 2555), so the crop offset stayed `(0, 953, 1440, 2555)`; the new
`reviews/evidence/P1-07-contract.png` is 1440 × 1602, 269098 bytes.

Re-run gate after the fix (the earlier record is kept):

